{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>26歲的內地頂流男神王俊凱8月15日晚在廣州舉行演唱會，吸引大批粉絲到場支持，事後更逼爆場館門外。</p><p>期間有狂粉疑趁司機離開，擅自打開車門躲進其車輛後廂偷拍，事後不但將畫面上傳社媒，還留言調侃，引發粉絲怒轟行為嚴重越界，令人毛骨悚然。</p><figure><img alt=\"王俊凱（微博@TFBOYS-王俊凱）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166402093989236736825196.jpeg/sM4R8vNQrYxMOsS0RyIAU85IvcGxD1WLHXXydB118nQ\"/><figcaption>王俊凱（微博@TFBOYS-王俊凱）</figcaption></figure><p>內地頂流男神王俊凱遭狂粉躲進車內偷拍：</p><figure><img alt=\"王俊凱遭狂熱粉絲躲進車中偷拍（抖音圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166403176618790912542617.jpeg/wNI7nwfe-aTcIpMvT2JDNMGsf2QgF7J4FXOcYhVznGI\"/><figcaption>王俊凱遭狂熱粉絲躲進車中偷拍（抖音圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王俊凱遭狂熱粉絲躲進車中偷拍（抖音圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166403178837708800739028.jpeg/wQlzSswVAl7Prf4dvXtK1vHJUnSm0Y_OcDykgnA8pII\"/><figcaption>王俊凱遭狂熱粉絲躲進車中偷拍（抖音圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王俊凱@TFBOYS。（微博@王俊凱KarryWang工作室）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210430/464849045988315136786251.jpeg/Yf9tmQGBufPEo10spxLox4XdPJUmRYVxJ06USidOlEo\"/><figcaption>王俊凱@TFBOYS。（微博@王俊凱KarryWang工作室）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王俊凱（微博@TFBOYS-王俊凱）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166404033464766464913472.jpeg/azUjMHblxhiPS7JNAE3by1Cjt22caQFXS0V0pEtFdKQ\"/><figcaption>王俊凱（微博@TFBOYS-王俊凱）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王俊凱（微博@TFBOYS-王俊凱）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166404036132474880735914.jpeg/Jru9yVRGx7aysHhN1isRduDEk5jAtOz0azPgRmsz4EY\"/><figcaption>王俊凱（微博@TFBOYS-王俊凱）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王俊凱（微博@TFBOYS-王俊凱）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166404039089590272358047.jpeg/yo4zkGb2YEqe-tv2CBXUiOSrdiZhSFFxoBaRkqAWkZI\"/><figcaption>王俊凱（微博@TFBOYS-王俊凱）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王俊凱（微博@TFBOYS-王俊凱）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166404041799241728915746.jpeg/2aV5sVdUsLsqLCfaDtb_g6UIPL4kP_jVfv7MwX7-zME\"/><figcaption>王俊凱（微博@TFBOYS-王俊凱）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王俊凱（微博@TFBOYS-王俊凱）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166404043946856448980461.jpeg/U5wqpmDvEz5BbUX78tGBf_KLKtVfhwIVqzwgwas8IME\"/><figcaption>王俊凱（微博@TFBOYS-王俊凱）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王俊凱（微博@TFBOYS-王俊凱）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166404022693793792419207.jpeg/wvxFUUeio2t0-WAFWwUSy8YnqBSDsUWnqL0f-ai9H_k\"/><figcaption>王俊凱（微博@TFBOYS-王俊凱）</figcaption></figure><p>有報道指涉事者長期跟蹤王俊凱，甚至曾在機艙偷拍。事件曝光後，網民促請工作室徹查，並加強藝人安全及私隱保護。</p><p>由於車廂屬私密空間，有法律人士指出這次偷拍嚴重侵犯王俊凱的私隱權及生活安寧權，相關的跟蹤、滋擾及糾纏明確違法，可判5日至10日拘留及罰款。另外，有粉絲質疑司機為何未鎖門窗及無人檢查車廂，工作人員是否存在「被收買」或內部泄露行程，理應徹查。</p><p>延伸閲讀：陸劇男神座駕遭噴紅字詛咒　揭曾被亡命追車：已嚴重威脅人身安全</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閲讀：陸劇男神座駕遭噴紅字詛咒　揭曾被亡命追車：已嚴重威脅人身安全】成毅（微博@成毅）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260115/1088517603594735616187054.jpeg/UVy4eYTD9nVwtz0vNSnrtRl2Zil5f68hyoLJ1cqCydU\"/><figcaption>【延伸閲讀：陸劇男神座駕遭噴紅字詛咒　揭曾被亡命追車：已嚴重威脅人身安全】成毅（微博@成毅）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"成毅（微博@成毅）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260115/1088517605826236416370962.jpeg/Kq94i_ukIXrgxZSbyZ1uvLxhDe9_Pap_sm0n0bJtJ9E\"/><figcaption>成毅（微博@成毅）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"成毅（微博@成毅）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260115/1088517574746312704713620.png/AFZfGFn9uF7Jaws69PQQ7vGGc57SPT-7eW2U1nltlNY\"/><figcaption>成毅（微博@成毅）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"成毅（微博@成毅）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260115/1088517576898121728943817.png/TkvLIwTLzFSlAIOoyogjZrMeCSvf0wWNrTCgiq0woIo\"/><figcaption>成毅（微博@成毅）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"成毅（微博@成毅）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260115/1088517602034061312932758.jpeg/Arw4S0HVQMHpBg8kXcFL0KSDIxmyKXkHaOV_R2jlf0c\"/><figcaption>成毅（微博@成毅）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"成毅（微博@成毅）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260115/1088517596925530112364759.jpeg/Wle0YrDZuTOCGSVN8FWFYFEWuEn2zQvPo0iNt6NIjbc\"/><figcaption>成毅（微博@成毅）</figc